p.src:
Treat this spin as a small subsystem in thermal equilibrium with everything else. Its partition function is $\begin{aligned}z
&=\sum_{\sigma=\pm1}e^{-\beta E(\sigma)}
 =\sum_{\sigma=\pm1}e^{\beta J\sigma} \\
&=e^{\beta J}+e^{-\beta J}
 =2\cosh(\beta J).\end{aligned}$

