&=-\frac{\partial}{\partial\beta}\log z \\
&=-J\frac{\sinh(\beta J)}{\cosh(\beta J)}
 =-J\tanh(\beta J).\end{aligned}$ Da $E=-J\sigma$ gilt, $\expect{\sigma}=\tanh(\beta J).$

